.TH CLAUDE-AGENTS-STATUS 1 2026-10-31 "claude-agents-indicator 0.3.0"
.SH NAME
claude-agents-status \- print the Claude Code sessions for a status bar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B claude-agents-status
.RB [ \-\-waybar ]
.RB [ \-\-follow ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B claude-agents-status
prints one line summing up the sessions from
.BR "claude agents" ,
such as
.IR "1 need you \(md 2 working" ,
and exits.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-waybar
Print the JSON a waybar custom module reads with
.BR "\(dqreturn-type\(dq: \(dqjson\(dq" :
the waiting count (or the session count when none waits) as text, the sessions
and usage as the tooltip, and one of attention, ready, working, idle or error as
the class.
.TP
.B \-\-follow
Keep running and print a new line whenever the sessions change.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success. 1 when claude cannot be run or does not answer within 10 seconds,
except with
.BR \-\-waybar ,
which reports the error in its output and exits 0. 2 on a bad option.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR claude-agents-tray (1)
